{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：15:25 2026-10-18 HKT</p>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/32acabf788101b4afc362c155bd5ac82/2026-10/001_12.png\"/>\n<p>今日（18日）下午2時許，警方接獲報案，指一對70多歲的夫婦倒卧屯門山景邨景榮樓的寓所內，奄奄一息，救援人員趕到現場，發現二人已陷昏迷，旁邊有一盤已燒過的炭，隨即將他們送往屯門醫院搶救。</p>\n<img alt=\"現場為屯門山景邨景榮樓。黃文威攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/426cbf90ab03c244201355df82037cdf/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-18_at_16_12_36.jpeg\" title=\"現場為屯門山景邨景榮樓。黃文威攝\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-18T08:38:37.685873+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":119,"images":2,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-18T07:25:23+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-18T08:37:37.340458+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-18T08:37:37.340458+00:00","content_hash":"604d7e895d49f3a2ce20d6d667bea15f34220047aea751d114cf3d70a1fb9f8e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}